#:mute

   #! Derivatives with respect to the reduced gradients gamma_ij =
   #! grad rho_i . grad rho_j, which are LibXC's own sigma variables. Each
   #! entry maps a multiset of CP2K derivative descriptors onto the LibXC
   #! array and the 1-based component holding it. Generated, not hand-written:
   #! the packing is LibXC's and there are 9/45/165 of them at meta-GGA level.

